's Reiju?Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:45.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Who knows? She went out earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:46.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Guest Room – The Vinsmoke FamilyDialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:02:00.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Father, where will Sanji and his wife live after they get married?Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:03.10,Main,,0,0,0,,With Germa, of course.Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,If we don't hold her as a hostage, we don't know what they'll demand hereafter.Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:15.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. A hostage, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:22.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll want to hold Sanji hostage too, in case something happens, eh?Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid, Niji.Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:31.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if they do that, would killing Sanji matter to us?Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:39.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait...Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:42.44,Main,,0,0,0,,... to live with Sanji again.Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:48.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Mirro-World" – Brûlée's HouseDialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:58.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be eaten!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are hungry, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We're starving!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:21.51,Main,,0,0,0,,This will be the finest game dish ever.Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:25.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Don-don-don't eat me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,– Let me down! – Just give up already.Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:42.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Brûlée has sealed her own downfall.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:48.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What? What?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.91,0:04:04.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The Carrot that got caught with me at that time was a fake.Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:10.85,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's a frog that was transformed into a mirror image of Carrot by Brûlée's ability.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The real Carrot...Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:20.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,... is in the attic.Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:24.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't eat me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:29.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! Help! Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:39.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But... I feel bad for the frog.Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:44.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There are 16 enemies in this house.Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:49.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The most troubling ones are Randolph, Aristocroc,Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:53.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,the mysterious chimney man Diesel,Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:55.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,and... Brûlée.Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:59.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,My only chance to catch them off-guard...Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:03.68,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,... is the moment they drop the fake Carrot.Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Randolph, cut the rope.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:15.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She's gonna freak out when she gets dropped in. I'll put the lid on right away.Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:19.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Here goes, Brûlée-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:25.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now! Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:26.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:29.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Winding up and...Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:47.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Randolph?Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée-sama, someone came down from the attic!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,There are two rabbit girls!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:05.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Good!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:14.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What is she gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:24.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Randolph! Just cut the rope!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:26.19,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:48.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! You can't do that! No!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Nooo!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:59.52,Main,,0,0,0,,– Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! -Brûlée-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:02.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch!!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:09.20,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,– Brûlée-sama! – This is bad news!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:25.98,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad! I gotta tell Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:31.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.85,0:08:35.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Choo-choo! Choo-choo! Choo-choo and choo-choo and choo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiots! No one can catch up with me once I start running...Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:42.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Guess who?Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:49.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:52.76,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no, no... Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Not yet!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:56.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I said "Let go of me"!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm gonna crash!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:06.19,Main,,0,0,0,,There!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! We beat Brûlée's group!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:17.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:19.45,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Now we can use Brûlée's ability to jump in and out of the mirrors!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's travel in this dimension across the island to look for everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:33.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sanji's RoomDialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:33.62,Main,,0,0,0,,May I come in-nasu?Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for going shopping.Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:39.64,Main,,0,0,0,,No problem-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, I've got some news-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:47.31,Main,,0,0,0,,We're currently holding Straw Hat and Cat Burglar captive-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:52.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They captured Luffy and Nami-san?Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:09.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you don't run away, everything will turn out for the best, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:15.59,Main,,0,0,0,,And a Mink man and Soul King are still rampaging.Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:16.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:22.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Sweet Commander Smoothie and Baron Tamago went to subdue them,Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,but they're still struggling to...Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough.Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I have my groceries?Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, here they are-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:36.60,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: This man ends his sentences with Nasu: Eggplant.Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:36.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're hungry, I can bring you something, like nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:38.07,Main,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:41.84,Main,,0,0,0,,– Can I use this kitchen? – What?Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:49.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan didn't show up for that last meal, so I'll cook something for her.Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:50.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I see-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about her.Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:11:00.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard that she still doesn't feel well...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:05.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,Treasure  RepositoryDialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.35,Main,,0,0,0,,These are the keys.Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:17.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro-san! I'll do it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:25.20,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you do that!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:28.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to do it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:52.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I asked my partner to risk his life before I came here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to get what I need...Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:07.66,Main,,0,0,0,,... or I'll lose face!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "I don't have a face to lose"?!!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:24.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Guards, can you hear me?Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got to hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:50.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the intruder in there?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! You didn't have to come! I can handle this!Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, Smoothie!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:14.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you know whose treasure...Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:22.03,Main,,0,0,0,,... you're messing with?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:24.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's...Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:30.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? What a strange creature!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.25,0:13:52.31,Main,,0,0,0,,The intruder is passing through the hallway near the Courtyard!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:54.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Corner him from both sides!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,All hands, shields up!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Charge!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Almost there!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! We cornered him in the Courtyard!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:34.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! What are they up to?Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a while-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:46.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Courtyard Inside of Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:53.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Pedro of the Nox Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Although you're my enemy, I've always respected you.Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,And now that we're facing one another...Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The scars on our left eyes both twitch-toi-et-moi.Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Five years ago, you really held on to your life.Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:19.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Why have you returned again?Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have much time left to live-soufflé.Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:28.07,Main,,0,0,0,,On that day, Mama took...Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:39.37,Main,,0,0,0,,... 50 years of your life-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know that.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:55.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not...Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:03.81,Main,,0,0,0,,... expecting to go home alive!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:37.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Not here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:49.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a ghost!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Not here, either.Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:03.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:15.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it farther ahead?Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:17.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:21.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is the mirror that leads to Whole Cake Chateau?Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:24.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Diesel! Do you know where to go?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.44,Main,,0,0,0,,How would I know?! Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:32.53,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as we're touching Brûlée, we can jump in and out of the mirrors!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:38.16,Main,,0,0,0,,This dimension is connected to the mirrors all across Whole Cake Island.Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We should've reached the castle already.Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée! Wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:45.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Gee!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:49.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we gotta try to find it ourselves until she wakes up!Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:52.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going until we find it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.37,0:17:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys will pay for this!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:11.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,Prison LibraryDialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:11.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Luffy! What are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:13.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no use...Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:21.76,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't stop, you're going to rip off your hands!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm trying to do!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:24.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no choice!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.83,0:18:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there any other way to get us out of here?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:37.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it better to have your arms torn apart...Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.72,Main,,0,0,0,,... than to die?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:42.95,Main,,0,0,0,,A little more to go!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! They're getting thinner than before!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I want!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:55.94,Main,,0,0,0,,While we're hoping for someone to come help,Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:19:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll lose everything, and eventually get killed by Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's so stupid! I don't wanna die like that!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Tear yours apart, too!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you crazy?! No way!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take care of you too, so quit moaning!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:23.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna see your arms being torn apart! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be so unreasonable!Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:27.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,... not going to die in a place like this!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.56,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.23,0:19:47.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sanji's Guest Room, Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:47.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap. I made a ton, like I always do.Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think Pudding-chan will eat this much.Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:53.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What am I thinking?Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:20:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, if she can't finish it, I'll eat it.Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You made a lot!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:08.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But I can't eat this much.Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have some, too?Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:13.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Open your mouth.Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That'll be nice!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:24.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan, here I come.Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going somewhere-nasu?Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:33.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm going to get comforted by my only ray of light in this world.Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:37.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Then do you want this eggplant-nasu?Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe later.Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:55.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Courtyard on the Third Floor Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:04.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Pedro Former Captain of the Nox Pirates Bounty: 382 Million BellyDialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:13.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago Knight of the Big Mom Pirates Bounty: 429 Million BellyDialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:21.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and Cat Burglar are already ours-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Give up-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,So, what?Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:29.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, let's have it out-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.14,0:22:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of the Minks-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:03.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess you're prepared.Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.24,0:22:07.80,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm wearing special tights that protect me from Electro-feuille.Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:11.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sort things out with you here!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:14.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers! It's you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:16.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– You-gara... – Pekoms.Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:19.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Pedro! Big Brother Zepo!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.27,0:22:20.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.50,0:22:22.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Garchu...Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.25,0:22:23.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:24.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Garchu...Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:26.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:31.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Grr! I'm a member of the Big Mom Pirates now.Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:37.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll lose more than an eye this time!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:19.74,Main,,0,0,0,,My left eye still twitches sometimes-feuille.Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.74,0:23:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember the pain of getting stabbed by you-toilette!Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.89,0:23:27.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember too, of course.Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:31.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done, you thieves.Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.67,0:23:39.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,W-What the...Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:41.14,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:57.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm taking 100 years of your life!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:02.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Zepo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:09.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Zepo...Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.80,0:24:11.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Zepo!!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:16.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Zepo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.59,0:24:21.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,There wasn't enough for 100 years.Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:27.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He only had 30 years to live.Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.36,0:24:34.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Since you're his partner, I need you to pay the rest.Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.95,0:24:43.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Now, give me 70 years worth of your soul!Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.46,0:24:47.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Please, Mama! He's like a big brother to me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.27,0:24:51.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you take 70 years, Big Bro Pedro will die too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.42,0:24:54.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop, Pekoms. That's pathetic-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.45,0:24:56.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.57,0:24:57.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Pekoms...Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.34,0:25:04.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop crying, Pekoms! All right.Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.60,0:25:08.77,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,10 years. I'll knock off 10 years.Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.77,0:25:10.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.44,0:25:16.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But you took away an eye from Tamago, and that's serious.Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.45,0:25:19.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll take 60 years of your life!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.90,0:25:30.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Aren't you satisfied, Pekoms?Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.00,0:25:32.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,W-Well...Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.51,0:25:40.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:45.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,How many years will you spare for this?Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.22,0:25:49.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:56.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to die here! The dawn of the new world is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.70,0:25:58.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I must go back to my country!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:09.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're so handsome.Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.22,0:26:12.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll reduce it to 50 years.Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.30,0:26:14.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Go on with your life.Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.41,0:26:32.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Say it-bon, Pedro! Why did you come back?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.71,0:26:41.07,Main,,0,0,0,,To this nightmarish island where your partner got killed and 50 years of your life was taken away!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.72,0:26:48.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats saved my homeland, and I'm indebted to them!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.81,0:27:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that, I believe they'll lead the world to the dawn one day!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.20,0:27:13.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.15,0:27:18.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The dawn of the world will come before long!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.73,0:27:30.21,Main,,0,0,0,,In time, the Straw Hats will surpass you-gara people and change the world!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.42,0:27:36.84,Main,,0,0,0,,They can't do anything! Where do you think you are-bon?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.84,0:27:39.26,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Whole Cake Island-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.26,0:27:41.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Does that matter?Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.69,0:27:45.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I believe in the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.06,0:27:49.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm happy to spend the short remainder of my life...Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.58,0:27:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,... helping them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.69,0:28:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,But don't get me wrong.Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die here!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.74,0:28:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They haven't fulfilled their reason for being here yet!Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.03,0:28:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die yet.Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.85,0:28:32.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Please. You let me through earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.93,0:28:34.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,In Front of Pudding's RoomDialogue: 0,0:28:32.77,0:28:35.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No means no, silly boy.Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,But why?Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.23,0:28:42.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama is currently b-u-s-y.Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:43.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Busy?Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.86,0:28:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your butt, silly boy. Go away, silly boy.Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.40,0:29:06.09,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.09,0:29:09.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I think there's a veranda outside her room.Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I can hand it in through the window.Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.87,0:29:39.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't do this. I'll look like a creep.Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:43.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Well... we'll be husband and wife tomorrow!Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.95,0:29:46.34,Main,,0,0,0,,So, even if she's changing...Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Or e-e-even if she's naked, there's nothing wrong with it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.43,0:30:01.90,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Good. She's laughing.Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.78,0:30:06.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There she is. Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.45,0:30:10.83,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Who is she talking to?Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.79,0:30:14.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Reiju?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.25,0:30:16.30,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why is she here?Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.30,0:30:18.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What does she want from Pudding-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.31,0:30:34.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You must be dreaming! Me, marry that lowlife?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.35,0:30:36.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Definitely not!Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.80,0:30:40.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Definitely not!Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.18,0:30:50.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Mama's favorite. Especially when it comes to my acting skill.Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.99,0:30:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,She cares about me so much, that it can really get annoying sometimes.Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.16,0:31:01.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It isn't hard for me to keep her happy, since I can easily manipulate any man.Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.17,0:31:04.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Tricking the Straw Hats was a piece of cake, too.Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.89,0:31:11.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Only my family knows my true nature.Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.93,0:31:21.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,Prison LibraryDialogue: 0,0:31:21.06,0:31:23.98,Main,,0,0,0,,This little...!Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.98,0:31:27.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Boy, he won't shut up-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.61,0:31:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn... that Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.66,0:31:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stop! They're really gonna be torn apart!Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.78,0:31:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make her pay...Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.29,0:31:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,,... no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.82,0:31:50.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So, don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.47,0:31:54.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to marry him.Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.37,0:31:59.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen.Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:05.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to marry him, because...Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.25,0:32:10.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... he's an idiot that played right into my hands by falling for me...Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.53,0:32:16.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... and because he's going to be shot in the middle of the ceremony...Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:21.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... by me.Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.08,0:32:28.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And you guys aren't going to survive, either.Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.00,0:32:42.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.60,0:32:44.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.77,0:32:50.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.28,0:32:53.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You pathetic rats.Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.61,0:32:58.49,Main,,0,0,0,,She was planning to set us up from the beginning!Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.49,0:33:02.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What did Sanji ever do to her?! Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.87,0:33:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You people are so naive!Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.16,0:33:12.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The evil army Germa 66?Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.16,0:33:16.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay in your fantasy world, you dumbasses!Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.38,0:33:28.24,Main,,0,0,0,,All Mama wanted was your army of clone soldiers...Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.24,0:33:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,... and your advanced technology!Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.61,0:33:42.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so obnoxious.Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.92,0:33:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,My, you are so defiant.Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.66,0:33:51.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That side of yours means you won't obey us, and is why we don't need you.Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.69,0:33:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The whole Germa Kingdom is anchored in our territory right now.Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.82,0:33:58.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are nothing more than flies...Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.74,0:34:01.85,Main,,0,0,0,,... that took the bait of a sweet, irresistible, political marriage involving Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.85,0:34:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Well done.Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.53,0:34:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gone just as Mama planned.Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.39,0:34:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,At the wedding tomorrow...Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.68,0:34:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,... The entire Vinsmoke Family...Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.81,0:34:22.83,Main,,0,0,0,,... will be executed!Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.50,0:34:50.86,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Attack Effects: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:26:21.22,0:26:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.85,0:01:34.44,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01:52.40,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,-Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:52.41,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:52.42,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,TDialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:52.43,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:52.44,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:52.71,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01: